---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import portrait from '../assets/profile/palash-outdoors.jpg';
---
<section class="about-band" id="about-me" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="container about-inner">
    <figure class="about-portrait" data-reveal>
      <Image
        src={portrait}
        alt="Palash looking out over mountains and clouds at sunset."
        widths={[320,480,640,960]}
        sizes="(max-width: 423px) calc(100vw - 62px), (max-width: 899px) 360px, 420px"
        format="webp"
        quality={82}
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <figcaption>Touching grass, whenever possible.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="about-copy" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">01 / A little about me</span>
      <h2 id="about-heading">Away from the keyboard,<br/><em>still exploring.</em></h2>
      <p>I've always been curious about what I haven't tried yet. That curiosity has taken me through skating, karate, badminton, cricket, dance, swimming—and the occasional sheet of paper folded into something unexpected.</p>
      <p>I'm never afraid to try or learn something new. I enjoy being a beginner, figuring things out, and finding something interesting in unfamiliar places. Whether I'm learning a new move, making something with my hands, or building software, the instinct is the same: give it a go, see what happens, and keep exploring.</p>
      <p class="about-signoff">Different interests. Same curiosity.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-band {
    background:var(--aubergine);
    color:var(--ice);
    padding-block:88px;
    --accent:var(--marigold);
    --on-accent:var(--aubergine);
    --focus:var(--marigold);
  }
  .about-inner {
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.85fr) minmax(0,1.15fr);
    align-items:center;
    gap:clamp(40px,6vw,88px);
  }
  .about-portrait {
    width:100%;
    max-width:444px;
    padding:12px;
    border:1px solid #dde3e826;
    border-radius:8px;
    background:#dde3e809;
  }
  .about-portrait img {
    aspect-ratio:3/4;
    object-fit:cover;
    border-radius:4px;
  }
  .about-portrait figcaption {
    padding:15px 7px 4px;
    font:italic 500 22px/1.3 var(--font-display);
    color:var(--ice);
  }
  .about-copy { min-width:0 }
  .about-copy .eyebrow { display:block; color:var(--marigold); margin-bottom:24px }
  .about-copy h2 { font-size:clamp(42px,4.3vw,62px); line-height:1.06; margin-bottom:28px }
  .about-copy h2 em { color:var(--marigold) }
  .about-copy p { font-size:16px; line-height:1.85; max-width:610px; color:#d1c8d1 }
  .about-copy p+p { margin-top:18px }
  .about-copy .about-signoff {
    color:var(--ice);
    font-size:13px;
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:.03em;
    margin-top:28px;
    padding-top:22px;
    border-top:1px solid #dde3e826;
  }
  @media(max-width:899px) {
    .about-band { padding-block:64px }
    .about-inner { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:38px }
    .about-portrait { max-width:384px; margin-inline:auto }
    .about-copy { max-width:650px; margin-inline:auto; width:100% }
    .about-copy h2 { font-size:48px }
  }
  @media(max-width:639px) {
    .about-band { padding-block:48px }
    .about-inner { gap:32px }
    .about-portrait { padding:10px }
    .about-portrait figcaption { font-size:21px; padding:12px 4px 3px }
    .about-copy .eyebrow { margin-bottom:18px }
    .about-copy h2 { font-size:clamp(39px,10vw,48px); margin-bottom:24px }
    .about-copy h2 br { display:none }
    .about-copy .about-signoff { margin-top:24px }
  }
</style>
